#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/the-event-loop.rst:2
msgid "The event loop"
msgstr "事件循环"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/the-event-loop.rst:4
msgid ""
"The event loop is the engine asyncio runs underneath. It keeps a list of "
"every task in the program, asks each one to run until that task's next "
"``await``, and moves on to the next ready task. When there are no ready "
"tasks it waits -- the actual wait is what makes the CPU available for "
"firmware to run other things and for power-saving sleeps to kick in -- until"
" something a task was awaiting becomes available, then resumes that task. "
"Repeat forever."
msgstr ""
"事件循环是 asyncio 在底层运行的引擎。它维护着程序中每个任务的列表，让每个任务运行到它的下一个 ``await``\\ "
"，然后转到下一个准备就绪的任务。当没有准备就绪的任务时，它会等待——这种实际的等待正是让 CPU "
"可供固件运行其他事务、并让省电休眠得以生效的原因——直到某个任务所等待的东西变得可用，然后恢复该任务。如此往复，永不停歇。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/the-event-loop.rst:13
msgid ""
"Most applications never interact with the loop directly. The loop is a "
"consequence of calling :func:`asyncio.run`; the application writes "
"coroutines, schedules them as tasks, and the loop does the rest."
msgstr ""
"大多数应用程序从不直接与循环交互。循环是调用 :func:`asyncio.run` "
"的结果；应用程序编写协程，将它们作为任务调度，其余的工作则交由循环完成。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/the-event-loop.rst:19
msgid "What :func:`asyncio.run` actually does"
msgstr ":func:`asyncio.run` 实际做了什么"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/the-event-loop.rst:21
msgid "A single call::"
msgstr "单单一次调用：："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/the-event-loop.rst:25
msgid ""
"is shorthand for a longer sequence the loop manages on the application's "
"behalf:"
msgstr "是循环代表应用程序所管理的一个更长序列的简写："

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/the-event-loop.rst:28
msgid "Create the event loop if it does not already exist."
msgstr "如果事件循环尚不存在，则创建它。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/the-event-loop.rst:29
msgid ""
"Wrap the supplied coroutine in a task and schedule it as the loop's top-"
"level entry point."
msgstr "将提供的协程包裹在一个任务中，并将其调度为循环的顶层入口点。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/the-event-loop.rst:31
msgid ""
"Run the loop -- step through ready tasks, wait when none are ready, resume "
"tasks when their awaits complete -- until the top-level task returns or "
"raises."
msgstr "运行循环——逐步执行准备就绪的任务，没有就绪任务时等待，当任务的 await 完成时恢复任务——直到顶层任务返回或抛出异常。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/the-event-loop.rst:34
msgid "Cancel any tasks the application created that are still running."
msgstr "取消应用程序所创建的、仍在运行的任何任务。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/the-event-loop.rst:36
msgid ""
"Return whatever the top-level coroutine returned (or re-raise whatever it "
"raised)."
msgstr "返回顶层协程返回的任何值（或重新抛出它所抛出的任何异常）。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/the-event-loop.rst:40
msgid "Single loop per program"
msgstr "每个程序一个循环"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/the-event-loop.rst:42
msgid ""
"MicroPython's asyncio has *one* event loop, full stop. There is no creating "
"a fresh loop, and there is no nesting one loop inside another. Calling "
":func:`asyncio.run` from inside a coroutine that is already running on the "
"loop is an error; the loop is already there, and the coroutine just needs to"
" await whatever it wanted to start."
msgstr ""
"MicroPython 的 asyncio 只有\\ *一个*\\ "
"事件循环，仅此而已。无法创建一个全新的循环，也无法在一个循环内部嵌套另一个循环。从一个已经在循环上运行的协程内部调用 "
":func:`asyncio.run` 是一个错误；循环已经在那里了，该协程只需要 await 它想要启动的任何东西。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/the-event-loop.rst:49
msgid ""
"In practice the rule is the same as the closing line of the previous page: "
"there is exactly one :func:`asyncio.run` call per program, at the top, with "
"a single ``async def main()`` behind it. Everything else lives inside "
"``main``."
msgstr ""
"实际上，这条规则与上一页的结尾那句话是一样的：每个程序恰好有一次 :func:`asyncio.run` 调用，位于顶层，其后跟着单独一个 "
"``async def main()``\\ 。其他一切都存在于 ``main`` 内部。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/the-event-loop.rst:55
msgid "Direct loop access"
msgstr "直接访问循环"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/the-event-loop.rst:57
msgid ""
"For the rare cases an application needs to touch the loop itself -- mostly "
"diagnostics and exception handlers -- :func:`asyncio.get_event_loop` returns"
" the :class:`~asyncio.Loop` object. From there the application can install a"
" custom exception handler, inspect what the loop is doing, or (very "
"occasionally) call :meth:`~asyncio.Loop.create_task` directly instead of "
":func:`asyncio.create_task` (they are the same operation)."
msgstr ""
"对于应用程序确实需要触及循环本身的少数情况——主要是诊断和异常处理程序——\\ :func:`asyncio.get_event_loop` 返回 "
":class:`~asyncio.Loop` 对象。应用程序可以从这里安装自定义异常处理程序、检查循环正在做什么，或者（极少数情况下）直接调用 "
":meth:`~asyncio.Loop.create_task` 而不是 :func:`asyncio.create_task`\\ "
"（它们是同一个操作）。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/asyncio/basics/the-event-loop.rst:66
msgid ""
"The full set of methods :class:`~asyncio.Loop` exposes -- "
":meth:`~asyncio.Loop.run_forever`, :meth:`~asyncio.Loop.stop`, "
":meth:`~asyncio.Loop.set_exception_handler`, and the rest -- is covered in "
"the :doc:`loop control <../loop/loop-control>` page later in this section. "
"Until then, ``asyncio.run(main())`` is all an application needs."
msgstr ""
":class:`~asyncio.Loop` 所公开的全部方法——\\ :meth:`~asyncio.Loop.run_forever`\\ 、\\ "
":meth:`~asyncio.Loop.stop`\\ 、\\ :meth:`~asyncio.Loop.set_exception_handler`"
" 等等——会在本节后面的 :doc:`循环控制 <../loop/loop-control>` 页面中介绍。在那之前，\\ "
"``asyncio.run(main())`` 就是应用程序所需的全部。"
